                    <th class="px-4 py-4 font-bold text-gray-600 text-sm">Approx. area</th>
                    <th class="px-4 py-4 font-bold text-gray-600 text-sm">Water-based kits (about 250 sq ft each)</th>
                    <th class="px-4 py-4 font-bold text-gray-600 text-sm">Buffer to add</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100">
